### DevPath API — example requests
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request".
@api = http://localhost:5080/api

### Health (also checks the database connection)
GET {{api}}/health

### Dashboard: overall progress, recommendation, skills, projects, activity
GET {{api}}/dashboard

### Whole roadmap with your progress
GET {{api}}/roadmap

### Paged, filtered topic list
GET {{api}}/topics?skill=EfCore&status=NotStarted&page=1&pageSize=5

### One topic with prerequisites, resources, exercises, interview questions...
GET {{api}}/topics/1

### Update your progress on a topic (status + prior knowledge + confidence 0-5)
PUT {{api}}/topics/1/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Completed", "knowledge": "Unassessed", "confidence": 4 }

### Validation error example → 400 ValidationProblemDetails
PUT {{api}}/topics/1/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Completed", "knowledge": "Unassessed", "confidence": 9 }

### "What should I study next?" for 45 minutes
GET {{api}}/recommendations?minutes=45&take=3

### A 60-minute study plan
GET {{api}}/study-plan?minutes=60

### Log a study session
POST {{api}}/study-sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "topicId": 1, "plannedMinutes": 30, "actualMinutes": 25, "sessionDate": "2026-10-19", "note": "Practised dotnet CLI" }

### Projects and one project with milestones, tasks and change requests
GET {{api}}/projects
###
GET {{api}}/projects/2

### Update a project task (Blocked requires a reason)
PUT {{api}}/project-tasks/1/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### Practice: the solution is only revealed after an attempt (409 otherwise)
POST {{api}}/practice/1/solution

### Notes CRUD
POST {{api}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "EF Core tip", "content": "Use AsNoTracking for read-only queries.", "topicId": 1 }

###
GET {{api}}/notes?q=AsNoTracking

### Spaced review queue
GET {{api}}/reviews

### Progress analytics, weekly review, career readiness
GET {{api}}/progress
###
GET {{api}}/progress/weekly
###
GET {{api}}/career-readiness

### Global search (English or Arabic)
GET {{api}}/search?q=linq

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET http://localhost:5080/openapi/v1.json
